{"id": "EUVD-2026-93970", "enisaUuid": "9d53d4a9-2425-306d-8006-ad5743295dd4", "description": "Symbolic name not mapping to correct class.\n\n\n\nBCEL caches attacker-controlled classes under their self-declared names without validating the requested name, allowing subsequent lookups and name-keyed verification results to refer to a different class.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Commons BCEL: before 6.13.0.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 6.13.0, which fixes the issue.", "datePublished": "2026-10-06T19:42:30", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T05:26:10", "baseScore": 8.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/apache/commons-bcel/commit/14890bf2b9014df25f9b4de86f29b5e917e5656b.patch", "https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/co1wfk2lyrmpnfhn49o370pvfl978rw6"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-94114", "GHSA-2p8h-ph4h-rm2f"], "assigner": "apache", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "61bb5968-30a0-35e8-ae9a-7a476c950970", "product": {"name": "Apache Commons BCEL", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0 <6.13.0"}, {"id": "96367e7b-1bb7-346f-b2a5-37ae1dd9b127", "product": {"name": "Apache Commons BCEL", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0 <14890bf2b9014df25f9b4de86f29b5e917e5656b"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "517d2b04-7530-3c14-986e-a9fae913024b", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}